{
  "summary": "Vendored qs library stringify implementation (qs/lib/stringify). It serialises an object into a query string, supporting arrayFormat brackets/comma/indices/repeat, allowDots, encode/encodeValuesOnly with a custom encoder, filter, sort, skipNulls, strictNullHandling, serializeDate, RFC formats (module 292) and utf-8/iso-8859-1 charset sentinels. Cyclic references are detected with side-channel maps (module 620) and throw RangeError(\"Cyclic object value\"); encoding/merging helpers come from qs utils (module 398).",
